# Where each dependency lives on THIS machine.
#
#   cp scripts/dependencies.conf.example scripts/dependencies.conf
#   # then paste your own absolute paths below
#
# dependencies.conf is gitignored -- it is per-machine, so it must never be
# committed. This example file is the tracked template.
#
# Paste the ROOT of each dependency, not its lib/ directory: the scripts probe
# for lib64/ then lib/ themselves, which is why CUDA (lib64) and TensorRT (lib)
# both work without you saying which is which.
#
# Absolute paths. Nothing has to live under the repo -- point at /opt, /usr/local
# or a shared NFS mount if that is where your stack is installed.
# Anything already exported in your environment overrides what is set here.

# --- GPU stack: needed by scripts/run_inference.sh only ----------------------

# CUDA toolkit root (contains lib64/)
CUDA_DIR=/path/to/cuda

# cuDNN root (contains lib/)
CUDNN_DIR=/path/to/cudnn

# TensorRT root (contains lib/)
TENSORRT_DIR=/path/to/TensorRT

# ONNX Runtime root (contains lib/ and include/)
ONNXRUNTIME_DIR=/path/to/onnxruntime-linux-x64-gpu

# --- monitoring: needed by scripts/run_prometheus.sh only --------------------

# Prometheus release directory (contains the `prometheus` binary)
PROMETHEUS_DIR=/path/to/prometheus-linux-amd64
